  "title": "Robot Girls Z",
  "justification": "Each AniDB episode holds three shorts, which TVDB season 1 lists one by one: episode 1 (2014-01-04) is episodes 1-3 \"Awesome! The Might of Robot Girls Z\" to \"Shocking! The Great Battle at the Numazu Coast\", episode 2 (2014-02-01) is 4-6 \"Race! The Great Robot Girls Athletic Meet!\" to \"Steamy! Operation Hot Springs\", episode 3 (2014-03-02) is 7-9 \"Fierce Battle! Baron Ashura Strikes Back\" to \"The Robot Girls Z Die at Dawn\". Specials S1-S5 (\"Episode 0\", the episode 3.5, 6.5 and 9.5 specials and \"The Resurrection of the Underground Empire!?\") are TVDB season 0 episodes 2-6 by title; episode 1 is the 2011 pilot (AniDB 8532). By default they fell one slot early.",
